\cf0 \strokec3 As Head of Facilitation at LaWayra, Monica brings a rare combination of clinical depth and direct ceremonial experience. Her background in psychology, neuroscience and psychiatric care allows her to support clients in translating profound inner experiences into grounded, real-life change.\
Her work integrates intuitive psychodynamic and schema-informed therapy, inner child work, and somatic and mindfulness practices. She focuses on identity shifts, relational patterns, emotional regulation, and helping clients move from insight into embodied, lasting transformation.\
